[center][size=6][b]Perfect Block Assist[/b][/size]
[size=4]Know when to block, or make every block perfect.[/size][/center]

[size=4][b]What it does[/b][/size]
Choose how you want to block in an in-game menu ([b]F6[/b]):
[list]
[*][b]Timing bar[/b]: when an enemy near you starts an attack, a bar appears under the crosshair. A marker runs towards the hit, and a [color=#59e36a]green zone[/color] marks the game's own Perfect Block window. Start blocking while the marker is inside it and [b]BLOCK![/b] appears. You still block by hand.
[*][b]Every block is perfect[/b]: any block that takes a hit counts as a Perfect Block. The game's original window comes back when you switch modes.
[*][b]Off[/b]
[/list]
The countdown is read from the attack animation every frame, so it follows combos, faster attacks and interrupted attacks. In testing it was within about 10 ms of the real hit. Works with every creature: spiders, ants, scorpions, mosquitoes, cockroaches, mites, larvae, bosses such as the Tarantula, and more.

[size=4][b]Menu (F6)[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][b]Up/Down[/b] choose an option, [b]Left/Right[/b] change it, [b]F6[/b] closes
[*]Mode: Timing bar / Every block is perfect / Off
[*]Bar lead time: 0.5 - 2.0 s before the hit
[*]Bar size: small, medium, large
[*]Bar position on screen
[/list]
While the menu is open, the bar runs as a preview so you can adjust it. Settings are saved in [i]config.ini[/i]. English and Brazilian Portuguese (follows the game's language).

[size=4][b]Requirements[/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Grounded 2 (Steam)
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/grounded2/mods/259]UE4SS for Grounded 2[/url]
[/list]

[size=4][b]Installation[/b][/size]
[list=1]
[*]Install [b]UE4SS for Grounded 2[/b] into [i]...\steamapps\common\Grounded2\Augusta\Binaries\Win64\[/i]
[*]Extract the [b]PerfectBlockAssist[/b] folder into [i]...\Grounded2\Augusta\Binaries\Win64\ue4ss\Mods\[/i] (enabled.txt included, no need to edit mods.txt)
[/list]
When you enter your world, the bar shows a short preview so you can see it works.

[size=4][b]Good to know[/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Pure UE4SS Lua mod: no game files are replaced and nothing runs outside the game.
[*]Multiplayer: "every block is perfect" works for the host only. The timing bar was mainly tested in single player.
[*]The mosquito's dive hits on contact, not at a fixed point of the animation, so it gets no bar.
[*]When several enemies attack at once, the bar shows the attack that lands first.
[*]The arrow keys also reach the game while the menu is open.
[*]Uninstall: delete the [i]ue4ss\Mods\PerfectBlockAssist[/i] folder. Nothing is changed in your save.
[/list]

[size=4][b]Troubleshooting[/b][/size]
[i]...\Win64\ue4ss\UE4SS.log[/i], lines starting with [b][PerfectBlockAssist][/b]. Set [i]Verbose = true[/i] at the top of [i]Scripts\main.lua[/i] to log every attack and block with its timing. Post the log in the Bugs tab or on GitHub.

[size=4][b]Source code[/b][/size]
[url=https://github.com/kamibiel/perfect-block-assist]github.com/kamibiel/perfect-block-assist[/url] (MIT)

[size=4][b]Credits[/b][/size]
Inspired by [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/grounded2/mods/198]PerfectBlockTrainer[/url] by diosama258. This is an independent mod; no files from it are included. Thanks to the UE4SS team.

[size=2]Not affiliated with Obsidian Entertainment, Xbox Game Studios or Microsoft.[/size]

[line]
[size=4][b]Português (BR)[/b][/size]
Escolha no menu do jogo ([b]F6[/b]): [b]barra de tempo[/b] (o marcador corre até o golpe e a faixa verde é a janela de bloqueio perfeito do próprio jogo; bloqueie quando ele estiver nela e aparece [b]BLOQUEIE![/b]) ou [b]todo bloqueio é perfeito[/b]. No menu, Cima/Baixo escolhem e Esquerda/Direita alteram; também dá para mudar a antecedência, o tamanho e a posição da barra. Instalação: copie a pasta [b]PerfectBlockAssist[/b] para [i]...\Win64\ue4ss\Mods\[/i]. Requer UE4SS for Grounded 2. No multiplayer, "todo bloqueio é perfeito" funciona só para quem hospeda.
